abstract: >-
  Replication package for the Empirical Software Engineering manuscript
  Measuring Reference Integrity in Coding-Agent Instruction Files: An
  Audited Longitudinal Study. Package version 1.2.1 is a documentation and
  metadata patch; frozen observational exports, human labels, protocols,
  and scientific results are unchanged from v1.2.0. Cite the Zenodo concept
  DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21711431 for the software family, and the minted
  version-specific DOI from the Zenodo landing for this release after
  archive. Science freeze date: 2026-07-03; validation extension: 2026-07-31.
